      "content": "i just miss him so much. it's like i'm living in a world that doesn't make sense anymore without him. sometimes i just sit here and think... if i could just be with him, the silence wouldn't matter. wouldn't it be more natural to just go where he is, instead of fighting to stay here in this void?",
